OL,3,GNEWSAA9 reopens after crash at  Dunkeld
OL,4,Acloses road for six hours
OL,5,
OL,6,FA single-vehicle collision forced the
OL,7,Fclosure of the A9 in both directions at
OL,8,FDunkeld for more than six hours.
OL,10,FEmergency services were alerted to the
OL,11,Fcrash at about 10:25.
OL,13,FAn air ambulance was also seen flying
OL,14,Fover the scene of the collision.
OL,16,FThe road reopened shortly before 16:30.
